NOTE P7 openOptions adds body.options-open (20735), closeOptions removes it (20740). The capture-phase introDismissHandler (registered at 17511-17512) runs before the graphics panel's bubble-phase ESC handler (20770), so this guard makes ESC/click-dim close options and return to the menu instead of dismissing the intro.
